paladin init

Initialize a new Paladin configuration

USAGE:
    paladin init [OPTIONS]

OPTIONS:
    -c, --config <FILE>    Configuration file path [default: config.yml]
    -f, --force            Overwrite existing configuration
    -h, --help             Print help information
